Having a pet killed when you're clvl 1 and between dlvl 1-6 should be
rare.  The monsters aren't likely to kill it, so the real danger is
traps.  Don't let your pet blunder around a room you haven't searched
until it has enough hp to take the damage.  In the mines there's really
nothing you can do about this, and it's easy to have your pet drop down
a trapdoor without your seeing.  I like to have multiple pets when I go
down there.  A whistle (even a normal one) is practically a necessity.


